{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zerra's Adventure is a classic turn-based RPG with no random encounters. Explore diverse areas, collect items and treasures to improve your team and defeat the strangest enemies. Level up, learn new attacks, and meet quirky characters on your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/title1eng.png?t=1749050543\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/Areas_new.gif?t=1749050543\" /><strong>Explore diverse landscapes</strong>, from frog-filled forests to infernal deserts and dark caves infested with spiders. Face dangers like spikes, fireballs, and shots as you search for treasures, weapons, and other items that will aid you in your adventure, even in a gym filled with insane bodybuilders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/title2eng.png?t=1749050543\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/Fight_2025.gif?t=1749050543\" /><strong>Confront a wide variety of enemies</strong>, from small turtles and pigs to armed rabbits and final bosses such as giant frogs and penguins. Utilize your skill and strategy to overcome their signature attacks and progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/title3eng.png?t=1749050543\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/Explore.gif?t=1749050543\" /><strong>Solve simple and classic genre puzzles</strong> during your adventure and find secret bonuses that will challenge you with short minigames that reward your skill with special and unique items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/title4eng.png?t=1749050543\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/Levelup1.gif?t=1749050543\" /><strong>Improve your party</strong> by gaining experience and leveling up. Discover new attacks and passive abilities that offer different benefits to the team. Customize each character with weapons and accessories found during your adventure, choosing between increasing attack, defense, or special abilities according to your gameplay style. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/title5eng.png?t=1749050543\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Strategic <strong>turn-based battles</strong> with no random encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six playable characters, each with their own <strong>unique attacks, skill tree and personalities!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore every nook and cranny of the 5 dungeons to <strong>discover treasure, secret areas</strong> and <strong>meet quirky characters</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy simple puzzles and minigames that offer <strong>tasty rewards</strong> to enhance your party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your team</strong> using the &quot;Accessory System&quot;: focus on attack, defense, healing, special abilities, or hundreds of other options!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Short and sweet:</strong> designed to complete the main story in under 10 hours, respecting your valuable time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Charming, original</strong> <strong>Pixel Art</strong> inspired by the 8-bit and 16-bit era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An <strong>energetic, personality-filled</strong> original soundtrack to accompany your adventure!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/Bannerdown.gif?t=1749050543\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2779580?t=1749050543","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749050543","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749050543","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749050543","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zerra's Adventure is a classic turn-based RPG with no random encounters. Explore diverse areas, collect items and treasures to improve your team and defeat the strangest enemies. Level up, learn new attacks, and meet quirky characters on your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/title1eng.png?t=1749050543\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/Areas_new.gif?t